abstract: "Lean 4 formalisation and exact certificates for a draft paper (26 November 2026, not peer reviewed) proving that non-zero real vectors indexed by the 3-subsets of [t], orthogonal whenever two subsets share exactly one element, need dimension at least floor(t/3)^2/5. No human mathematician has checked the work; it was produced with an AI system (Claude) under the direction of the author."
